WEBVTT

00:30:56.427 --> 00:31:00.490
and she was going to miss dinner
and have to go to the evening meeting.

00:31:00.514 --> 00:31:03.887
So her driver said,
"Let me order you some takeout."

00:31:03.911 --> 00:31:06.347
So he managed to order takeout,

00:31:06.371 --> 00:31:10.743
delivered to the limousine
that she was in,

00:31:10.767 --> 00:31:13.662
by estimating how fast they would be,

00:31:13.686 --> 00:31:15.780
and she rolled down the window

00:31:15.804 --> 00:31:19.160
and the food was passed in
by the person on a moped.

00:31:19.480 --> 00:31:23.458
So these kinds of almost
science-fiction-like capabilities

00:31:23.482 --> 00:31:25.561
are now real in China.

00:31:25.585 --> 00:31:28.505
And people would work in these companies,

00:31:28.529 --> 00:31:29.871
in Meituan, for example,

00:31:29.895 --> 00:31:31.831
for 100 hours a week,